{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45841","headline":"送高九经赴举 · 贯休","name":"送高九经赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回也曾言志，明君则事之。\n中兴今若此，须去更何疑。\n志列秋霜好，忠言剧谏奇。\n陆机游洛日，文举荐衡时。\n虎迹商山雪，云痕岳庙碑。\n夫君将潦倒，一说向深知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}